      "description": "A scene depicting a burning sage bundle (smudge stick) in a wooden bowl with stones, commonly used in spiritual or cleansing rituals. The smoke rising from the sage bundle indicates active burning. The text 'what's burning?' overlays the image, prompting reflection on the literal or symbolic meaning of the burning object.",
