      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "spiritual_practices",
      "label": "Spiritual Practices",
      "description": "The image and text reference spiritual or metaphysical practices, which are not visually explicit but are essential to understanding the meme’s intent. The question 'what's burning?' invites the viewer to consider the symbolic meaning of the smoke and the ritual, which is only meaningful if one is aware of the spiritual context in which such practices occur.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
